            "body": "This release contains changes for datasets:\n\n- Bundibugyo ebolavirus (nextstrain/orthoebolavirus/bdbv)\n- Swine Influenza A - PB1 (segment 2) (community/anses/swIAV/PB1)\n- Swine Influenza A - N2 (segment 6) (community/anses/swIAV/N2)\n- Swine Influenza A - MP (segment 7) (community/anses/swIAV/MP)\n- Swine Influenza A - PB2 (segment 1) (community/anses/swIAV/PB2)\n- Swine Influenza A - N1 (segment 6) (community/anses/swIAV/N1)\n- Swine Influenza A - H3 (segment 4) (community/anses/swIAV/H3)\n- Swine Influenza A - NS (segment 8) (community/anses/swIAV/NS)\n- Swine Influenza A - H1 (segment 4) (community/anses/swIAV/H1)\n- Swine Influenza A - PA (segment 3) (community/anses/swIAV/PA)\n- Swine Influenza A - NP (segment 5) (community/anses/swIAV/NP)\n\n\n\n## Bundibugyo ebolavirus (nextstrain/orthoebolavirus/bdbv)\n\nInclude additional 2026 outbreak sequences and update reference tree.\n\n\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - PB1 (segment 2) (community/anses/swIAV/PB1)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - N2 (segment 6) (community/anses/swIAV/N2)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - MP (segment 7) (community/anses/swIAV/MP)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - PB2 (segment 1) (community/anses/swIAV/PB2)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - N1 (segment 6) (community/anses/swIAV/N1)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - H3 (segment 4) (community/anses/swIAV/H3)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - NS (segment 8) (community/anses/swIAV/NS)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - H1 (segment 4) (community/anses/swIAV/H1)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - PA (segment 3) (community/anses/swIAV/PA)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n\n## Swine Influenza A - NP (segment 5) (community/anses/swIAV/NP)\n\n - inital build for preprint release \"Genetic diversity and phylogeography of swine influenza A virus in 2013-2022 in Europe using a harmonized genotyping nomenclature\"\n\n",
